            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
              Audit trails & compliance
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
              SLA guarantee (99.9% uptime)
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
              Dedicated account manager
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a
          href="https://polar.sh/mekongmind"
          class="mt-8 block w-full text-center rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors duration-200 cursor-pointer"
        >
          Contact Sales
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 text-center text-sm text-slate-500">
      All plans include BYOK support. No hidden fees.
      <a href="https://polar.sh/mekongmind" class="text-sky-700 hover:text-sky-800 font-medium cursor-pointer">View Polar checkout →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
